  "releaseNotes": "Preserve parsed standard default Authorization headers in private configured clients, bind MVC arguments without a redundant transport array, and cache routed operation names. Preserve request-specific authentication, scoped service resolution, validation, full payload audit, masking, cancellation and route/contract guards. Compatible with the 4.x wire format and schema hashes; no end-to-end GET latency improvement is guaranteed. See CHANGELOG.md.",
